  "readme": {
    "available": true,
    "excerpt": "dsh-search-enhance is a search extension for DeepSeek Harness. It uses a Grok-compatible Search API for primary web answers and can optionally use Context7, Exa, Tavily, Firecrawl, and Parallel for documentation lookup, supplementary discovery, page extraction, and site mapping."
